        -:  285:/**
        -:  286:    Intermediate template for the generic value type implementation.
        -:  287:    We can derive from this same value type for multiple actual types
        -:  288:    (for instance, we can have wxAnyValueTypeImplInt for all signed
        -:  289:    integer types), and also easily implement specialized templates
        -:  290:    with specific dynamic type conversion.
        -:  291:*/
